{"question_id": "630680428571", "solver_id": "quant-b", "model": "sonnet", "prompt_version": "solver_v1", "answer_option": "D", "answer_value": "9/4", "method": "Boats and streams ratio", "steps": ["Down:up=10:4=5:2", "30/5k+30/2k=14 -> k=1.5", "down 7.5, up 3, stream 2.25=9/4"], "check_code": "from fractions import Fraction as F\nk=F(30,5)+F(30,2)\nk=k/14\nd,u=5*k,2*k\nr=str((d-u)/2)\nassert 30/float(d)+30/float(u)==14 or abs(30/float(d)+30/float(u)-14)<1e-9\nassert r=='9/4'\nassert r!='4/9'\nassert r!='9/2'\nassert r!='2/9'\n", "confidence": 0.97}
{"question_id": "630680183249", "solver_id": "quant-b", "model": "sonnet", "prompt_version": "solver_v1", "answer_option": "A", "answer_value": "3", "method": "Value putting A=60", "steps": ["cosec=2/√3: first bracket=2cosec²/(cosec²-1)=8", "second=2sec²/(sec²-1)=8/3", "8/(8/3)=3"], "check_code": "from sympy import *\nA=pi/3\nc=1/sin(A);s=1/cos(A)\nr=str(simplify((c/(c-1)+c/(c+1))*(s/(s-1)+s/(s+1))**-1))\nassert r=='3'\nassert r!='4'\nassert r!='1'\nassert r!='2'\n", "confidence": 0.93}
